posts.text:
If states have nothing to hide, why are they fighting voter roll transparency?

The DOJ is suing states that refuse to turn over voter records, while the administration pushes new measures to verify eligible voters.

@tzsmith is a Senior Legal Fellow of Courts and the Constitution at The Heritage Foundation.

